<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <data noupdate="1">

        <record id="mail_template_lead_inquiry" model="mail.template">
            <field name="name">Greenpr: Website Lead 견적 문의 알림</field>
            <field name="model_id" ref="crm.model_crm_lead"/>
            <field name="subject">[문의] {{ object.name or '제목없음' }} 견적 문의 - {{ object.partner_name or object.contact_name or '방문자' }}</field>
            <field name="email_from">{{ (object.company_id.email_formatted or user.email_formatted) }}</field>
            <field name="email_to">greenpr9@gmail.com</field>
            <field name="auto_delete" eval="False"/>
            <field name="description">greenpr 웹사이트 /contactus 폼 유입 crm.lead 생성 시 greenpr9@gmail.com 으로 발송되는 견적 문의 알림 템플릿.</field>
            <field name="body_html" type="html">
<div style="font-family: 'Nanum Gothic', Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 14px;">
    <h2 style="color:#0b8043; margin:0 0 12px 0;">새 견적 문의가 접수되었습니다</h2>
    <p>greenpr.online 웹사이트 <strong>/contactus</strong> 폼을 통해 새로운 <strong>견적 문의</strong>가 등록되었습니다.</p>
    <table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse; margin: 12px 0; width:100%; max-width:600px;">
        <tbody>
            <tr style="background-color:#f4f4f4;">
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; width:160px; font-weight:bold;">Lead 제목</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.name or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">담당자 이름</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.contact_name or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background-color:#f4f4f4;">
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">회사명</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.partner_name or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">이메일</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.email_from or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background-color:#f4f4f4;">
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">전화번호</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.phone or object.mobile or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">직책</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.function or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background-color:#f4f4f4;">
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold; vertical-align: top;">문의 내용</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;">
                    <div t-out="object.description or ''">
                        (본문 없음)
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd; font-weight:bold;">유입 경로</td>
                <td style="border:1px solid #dddddd;"><t t-out="object.source_id.name or ''"/> / <t t-out="object.medium_id.name or ''"/></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p style="color:#777777; font-size: 12px;">
        본 메일은 greenpr_form_automation 모듈의 base.automation 규칙에 의해 자동 발송되었습니다. Odoo에서 Lead ID <t t-out="object.id or ''"/> 를 확인해 주세요.
    </p>
</div>
            </field>
        </record>

    </data>
</odoo>
